#: source/how-to/wrap_rl_env.rst:80
msgid ""
"To record videos, add a "
":class:`~envs.utils.video_recorder_cfg.VideoRecorderCfg` to the environment "
"configuration. It records from a visualizer (or a camera sensor) into "
"``mp4`` clips while the environment steps, so no wrapper or ``render_mode`` "
"is needed, and the runtime the visualizer needs starts automatically."
msgstr ""
"要录制视频，将 :class:`~envs.utils.video_recorder_cfg.VideoRecorderCfg` "
"添加到环境配置。它会在环境步进时，从可视化器或相机传感器录制 ``mp4`` 片段，因此无需包装器或 ``render_mode`` "
"，且会自动启动可视化器所需的运行时。"

